// MEC kit lineup on Strike at Karkand: each class's own gear (vest, pack, helmet, ghillie
// suit, radio, ...) layered over the plain body, redeploying as every kit in turn so they can
// be compared side by side via scripts/sheet.py. Kit slot order on this level is specops,
// sniper, assault, support, engineer, medic, at (see projectile_assault.ron for "kit:2" ==
// assault).
// client --scenario scenarios/animation/kits_mec.ron --tp-offset 3.2,0.4,0 --out target/scenarios/kits/mec
(
    level: "strike_at_karkand",
    bots: 0,
